abstract: >-
  Code, preregistration, configuration and result files for an audit and preregistered rebuild of a 2024
  SUMO + machine-learning study of emission-aware rerouting in Flushing, Queens. The code was developed with the
  assistance of Claude (Anthropic), an AI coding assistant, under the authors' direction (README, "Use of AI
  tools"). OpenStreetMap-derived data are under ODbL 1.0 (NOTICE.md).
